<title>USA: MidSouth Bancorp sets 12.5 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>MidSouth Bancorp sets 12.5 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, La. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>MidSouth Bancorp Inc said Wednesday it has set a 12.5 percent stock dividend on its common stock to holders of record as of August 6.</p>
<p>The dividend is to be paid out on August 27.</p>
<p>After the stock dividend, MidSouth will have 1,554,207 shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
